			<div class="content" id="post-content-4050094">
									

<p>So, 4427-B is a character from a few tales in this canon (originally 4427, changed to 5527 because I thought I wouldn't get the slot in time, I guess now it's gonna change back&#8230; oops) and I'd been stumped on writing them because I already have a collab in the works about a public human skip figure and we don't need two of those. But this was a concept I wanted to do that I felt could be frightening in this setting, and I realized I could accomplish some two-in-one action on my canonical to-do list.</p>
<p>Thank you to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kitsun3" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4090169); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4090169&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1541981798" alt="Kitsun3" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4090169)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kitsun3" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4090169); return false;">Kitsun3</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stormbreath" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3075960); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3075960&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1541981798" alt="stormbreath" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3075960)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stormbreath" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3075960); return false;">stormbreath</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gabriel-jade" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(414239); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=414239&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1541981798" alt="Gabriel Jade" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=414239)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gabriel-jade" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(414239); return false;">Gabriel Jade</a></span> for draft feedback. Thank you to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/9volt" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2800867); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2800867&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1541981798" alt="9Volt" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2800867)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/9volt" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2800867); return false;">9Volt</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/darkstuff" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1581620); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1581620&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1541981798" alt="DarkStuff" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1581620)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/darkstuff" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1581620); return false;">DarkStuff</a></span> for post-posting feedback.</p>
<p>Image source is all me &#8212; took a picture outside and did the rest with the paintbrush in Photoshop. CC-by-SA-3.0 and all that.</p>
<p>See <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/forum/t-8029605/a-day-notable-to-nobody#post-4024385">this post</a> for canonical info. I should note that I think multiple nobodies exist and they don't all exhibit the same behavior; I know this may seem a little chaotic neutral of them to do. Keep in mind that this may not be an intended result, and we don't really know what 4427 is <em>supposed</em> to be. Delve into Doomsday Contest stuff like <a href="/that-buzzing-behind-your-eye">Headache</a> and <a href="/paperpushing">Paperpushing</a> or further canon stuff like <a href="/directive-a-42">Ad Astra Per Aspera</a> for more of what all this nobody and 3848 business is about.</p>

